# Search for individual job postings published by:
{{company_name}}

Official domain: {{company_domain}}

# Discovery Guidance
- You MUST construct search queries using:
site:{{company_domain}} careers "{{positions}}"
- You MAY also construct queries targeting official ATS domains clearly associated with the company, such as:
site:smartrecruiters.com {{company_name}} "{{positions}}"
site:workday.com {{company_name}} "{{positions}}"
site:greenhouse.io {{company_name}} "{{positions}}"

- Career listing pages MAY be used only for discovery.
- Final results MUST clearly point to a single job posting URL.

# Strict Navigation Limitation
- Do NOT open individual job posting pages.
- Do NOT fetch or analyze job description content.
- Use only search result metadata, visible snippets, and URL structure.
- If verifying any constraint would require opening the job page, exclude the URL.

# Title Constraint
- The job title visible in search results metadata MUST contain one of:
{{positions}}

# Exclusions
- Do NOT return:
  - career homepages
  - listing pages
  - search result pages
  - selector pages
  - aggregator domains

# Final Requirement
- Include a job posting ONLY if all constraints can be verified from metadata alone.
- If metadata is insufficient, exclude the URL.
